('859b94d8c8b0eeee', '330cc9dea0ab0446', 1, 'resolution of flood conmtrl', 'ORDINANCE NO. ___\n\nAN ORDINANCE RESOLUTION OF FLOOD CONMTRL\n\nBE IT ORDAINED by the Sangguniang Panlungsod, in session assembled, that:\n\nSECTION 1. Short Title. - This ordinance shall be known as the \"resolution of flood conmtrl\".\n\nSECTION 2. Declaration of Policy. - This ordinance is intended to promote public welfare, good governance, and responsive public policy.\n\nSECTION 3. Implementation. - The concerned city offices shall implement this ordinance in accordance with existing laws, ordinances, and regulations.\n\nSECTION 4. Separability. - If any provision of this measure is declared invalid, the remaining provisions shall remain in full force and effect.\n\nSECTION 5. Effectivity. - This measure shall take effect upon its approval, unless otherwise provided by law.\n\nENACTED,\n________________________\nDate: September 12, 2026', 'LIVE-RADIO-DRAMA-SKIT-COMPETITION-Year-4-Final-Mechanics (2).pdf', 'b85e780c41ee682a_LIVE-RADIO-DRAMA-SKIT-COMPETITION-Year-4-Final-Mechanics__2_.pdf', '649a3d757a6c5a0ffc32cab718be8aefd328a32934d656691eb0a5725c096c49', '7486bc1d2df7e69c', 'isu', '2026-09-12 21:37:46.000000', 'Baseline snapshot migrated from existing record', NULL, '330cc9dea0ab0446', 'Revision v1'),
